{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764489,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"War Zone","festival_id":520576,"organization_id":652294,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-01T22:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-16T15:25:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/warzone-tech-melange-2026-shaheed-rajguru-college-of-applied-sciences-for-women-delhi-university-1764489","region":"offline","details":"<p>Hello Gamers!<\/p>\n<p>Get ready to test your skills, strategy, survival instincts and competitive spirit across three challenging rounds.<\/p>\n<p>Registration is free.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Tournament Format:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 1:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The tournament begins with an individual Custom Match on the Erangel map.<\/p>\n<p>At the end of the match, the top 24 players on the final scoreboard will qualify for the next round.<\/p>\n<p>Approx. Duration: 45&ndash;50 minutes<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 2:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The 24 qualified players will be randomly divided into 6 teams of 4 through a chit-based selection system to ensure fairness.<\/p>\n<p>The 6 teams will then be paired against each other resulting in 3 team face-offs. This round will leave us with the 12 players who qualify for the Grand Finale.<\/p>\n<p>Approx. Duration: 45 minutes<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 3:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The final 12 players will enter a Custom Erangel Match.<\/p>\n<p>A specific drop location will be announced on the spot before the match. Any player landing elsewhere will be immediately disqualified.<\/p>\n<p>The Top 3 players will be declared the winners based on their final scoreboard position.<\/p>\n<p>Approx. Duration: 30 minutes<\/p>\n<p><strong>Rules:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each participant must register individually for the tournament.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must carry their valid college identity card.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li>Participants must carry their own compatible device with BGMI installed before reaching the venue.<\/li>\n<li>Participants are responsible for ensuring that their device has sufficient battery and a stable internet connection.<\/li>\n<li>Participants are expected to maintain sportsmanlike conduct throughout the event. Any misconduct, abusive behaviour or deliberate disruption of the match may result in disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>Room ID and password\/code will be shared with the participants before the respective match.<\/li>\n<li>Late entries will not be entertained once the respective match has started.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Note: <\/strong>Any college student from the University of Delhi or outside with valid ID card can participate.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Date:<\/strong> 16\/10\/2026<\/p>\n<p><strong>Reporting Time:<\/strong> 12:45 PM&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Venue:<\/strong> Lab 1, CS Department, SRCASW<\/p>\n<p><strong>Join group for further communication:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/Bd71avQVyjWBK7oDuR0Exy\">https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/Bd71avQVyjWBK7oDuR0Exy<\/a><\/p>","overall_prizes":"Compete for a total prize pool of \u20b95,000 by securing a spot in the Top 3 of WAR ZONE!   ","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":27948975,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-01T20:23:10+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T15:38:39+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"FtEVkUo","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":12,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo